// Q-126 A service called from a helper is not seen as the http effect: `fn f() with db = load()` passes, where calling the service directly warns
// mode: check
// fixed-when: may use the http effect
// From FEEDBACK16.md §Q-126 (found on b28e689).

service billing = "billing.qwe"

fn load() = billing.invoice()
fn f() with db = load()
